    {
      "id": "claim_cb2fceebf4444a12ab575c3507289cdb",
      "statement": "The OPENPROJECT_URL environment variable sets the default OpenProject API base URL (default https://localhost). The OPENPROJECT_ALLOW_HEADER_BASE_URL variable, when set to true, trusts the X-OpenProject-Base-Url HTTP header from MCP clients to override the configured base URL, enabling multi-backend routing.",
