      "id": "claim_24472dc2a3434725816b97e05e8a966f",
      "statement": "The Docker HEALTHCHECK queries the readiness probe at http://127.0.0.1:8081/actuator/health/readiness every 5 minutes with a 3-second timeout, 20-second start period, and 3-retry threshold. The management server runs on port 8081 separate from the main HTTP port 8080.",
