    {
      "id": "claim_0136816c44b8406094f713f22d35fde2",
      "statement": "MCP endpoints on port 8080 (/mcp, /sse) use bearer-token authentication via McpBearerAuthenticationFilter, which validates the Authorization header against the OpenProject API. The filter is explicitly excluded from global servlet registration so it only runs within the Spring Security chain.",
      "evidence": [
