    {
      "id": "claim_fd43d32fd20542f983cfa019a1d9aaa0",
      "statement": "The MCP server defaults to the SSE (Server-Sent Events) protocol, which exposes GET /sse for server-to-client streaming and POST /mcp/message for client-to-server communication. The alternative STREAMABLE protocol uses a single bidirectional /mcp endpoint. Only one protocol can be active at a time.",
